# Social-work ecomap: single parent Maya and two young children, balancing strong kin support and school stress.
ecomap "Maya's Family Support Network"
  center: family [label: "Maya + children"]
  grandmother [label: "Grandmother", category: family, importance: major]
  school [label: "Early Childhood Center", category: education]
  employer [label: "Grocery Job", category: work]
  clinic [label: "Pediatric Clinic", category: health]
  neighbors [label: "Neighbors", category: community]
  family === grandmother
  family == school
  family ~~~ employer
  family --- clinic
  family == neighbors
